--- !u!114 &1460990536
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1460990534}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 
  _lines:
  - New game. New everything. Put the tracks and the buttons and the gun clean out
    of your head, we are doing something completely different tonight, you and I.
    We are going on an adventure.
  - I am going to be your Dungeon Master. It is a game the living play, with dice
    and heroes and dragons, and the whole point is that I describe a world and you
    pretend to walk through it and make choices, and I pretend those choices matter.
    I am very good at it. I have never once let anybody win who I did not want to.
  - So sit up. Roll up a hero. Try, for one hour, to be a knight instead of a defendant.
    It will not last. It never does. But let us find out who you are when there are
    dragons in front of you instead of dilemmas. Begin.
  _clickLockout: 0.25
  _clearAtEnd: 0
