  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2127019470}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 
  _lines:
  - And that is the adventure. The whole silly, earnest, made up thing. Knights and
    dice and a dragon I built a size too big on purpose.
  - You want to know the funny part. You were more honest in there, pretending to
    be somebody else, than you have been in a single one of the real questions. People
    always are. Hand a man a mask and he finally shows you his actual face.
  - Rest your sword arm, hero. There is more, of course. There is always more. But
    that was a good one. Even I had fun, and I am dead inside, professionally.
  _clickLockout: 0.25
  _clearAtEnd: 0
